  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>一个已接近完成的项目，开发历时3年以上</strong><br>基于原版材质，这是一款16x PBR叠加资源包，适用于PBR着色器（推荐使用Kappa、Apollo）&nbsp;<br><strong>特性：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">POM</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">法线贴图</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">高光贴图</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">发光贴图</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">CTM</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">更多功能<br><strong>需要完整支持CTM。</strong><br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/R2w1Am5ZrqE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"447\" width=\"447\"></iframe></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">LabPBR：开启</span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>法线贴图：开启</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>资源包反射：开启<br></strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>POM：开启</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>推荐设置</strong></span><strong style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif\">&nbsp;POM深度为 .2/25</strong></strong></span></p>",
